    "created_at": "2025-09-25T22:45:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-25T22:45:21Z",
    "body": "https://searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/30ea9a2fd7271e9c731df414bd80e46edc3190eb/modules/zlib/src/deflate.c#979-981\n\n```cpp\n    /* Make sure there is something to do and avoid duplicate consecutive\n     * flushes. For repeated and useless calls with Z_FINISH, we keep\n     * returning Z_STREAM_END instead of Z_BUF_ERROR.\n```\n\nWell, I guess that's why I considered it as an error, at least. Probably some spec clarification would be okay.",
